  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Brush the piadina with olive oil and bake in the oven for 2-3 minutes, or until crispy.",
    "3. Remove the piadina from the oven and top with a spoonful of burrata cheese.",
    "4. Add a few slices of heirloom tomato on top of the cheese.",
    "5. Sprinkle with chopped fresh basil.",
    "6. Finish with a spoonful of ikura on top.",
    "7. Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "9. If desired, add a drizzle of olive oil and a sprinkle of salt on top."
